  "qualification": {
    "category": "not a fit",
    "rationale": "North Star Kitchen and Bath Remodels is a residential kitchen and bathroom renovation contractor specializing in cabinetry, countertops, flooring, and full-scale room remodels rather than an HVAC, plumbing, or electrical home-service contractor. In addition, the website does not verify a headcount of 10 to 75 staff, and it already embeds a msgsndr.com survey widget for lead capture."
  }
